  "notes": "Extra read of the same detector as metrics.json at the level D5's headline rule picks from the SCORING-period noise curve, so D2, D4, D6, D7 and I1 here are tuned on test (exploratory, for comparison with the reference at its own noise). Logistic regression (L2 lambda 1) on -log10 s_A, -log10 s_B and a both-fired indicator, trained on year-1 injections (200 rare + 200 common ESBL clusters of 4, 2024-04-01 to 2024-08-15, seed 2026) and year-1 real cell-days; harness p = upper-tail share of the 2024-01-01 to 2024-09-30 background with the same or a larger linear predictor. Operating level (loosest with year-1 noise at most 5 a year) p = 0.0003. Join: cell = unit x organism-or-phenotype, 7-day carry-forward, silent = 1, new-in-unit = 1e-6 (all proposed (overnight), pending Artem). Seed 2026, 200 trials per cell. Plan: experiments/0022-ensemble/README.md.",
